;;; The twin of `kw-not-fact.ein`, a control of regression `kw-not-fact`: the same program with
;;; `notw` renamed `nnotw`, its first letter doubled: a name that starts with no
;;; keyword and sorts where `notw` does. Its answer is the witness's right one,
;;; the name read back (`ein solve FILE` at `35186bc0`, release and debug).
;;;

(relation p Node :why "p holds of {?3}") (relation nnotw :why "nnotw holds")
(p a) (nnotw)
